    <div>
      <div class="wordmark wordmark-sm">LivedHere</div>
      <p>Reviews from people who actually lived there — renters and owners.</p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Footer">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/about">About</a>
